-- spUpdateEntity on MJ_BizApps_Common: People (turns on EnableFieldLevelSecurity) and the 108 Entity
-- Field Permission rows MJ's reconcile then created from this build database's own roles. Hosts
-- upgrade by migration only, so shipping those rows would apply this database's snapshot, not each
-- host's; and with the flag on, a field with no row is denied to every user.
--
-- TRANSFORMS: `EXEC [${flyway:defaultSchema}]` -> `EXEC [${mjSchema}]` (both calls are core SPs).
